WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.179
Benjamin and Peter walked through the woods.

2
00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:22.958
At last they saw a stone wall.

3
00:00:22.959 --> 00:00:31.414
"The farmer's garden!" said Peter.

4
00:00:31.415 --> 00:00:37.363
The two rabbits climbed onto the wall.

5
00:00:37.364 --> 00:00:40.579
Peter gasped.

6
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.088
"Look at that scarecrow!

7
00:00:44.089 --> 00:00:48.706
It's wearing my jacket and shoes!"

8
00:00:48.707 --> 00:00:52.983
"Let's get them back!" said Benjamin.

9
00:00:52.984 --> 00:00:56.975
"I don't know," said Peter.

10
00:00:56.976 --> 00:01:02.324
"We'll be fine," said Benjamin.

11
00:01:02.325 --> 00:01:05.457
He grabbed a pear tree.

12
00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:12.262
Then he slid down into the garden.

13
00:01:12.263 --> 00:01:14.474
Peter followed.

14
00:01:14.475 --> 00:01:19.439
Benjamin and Peter ran to the scarecrow.

15
00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:23.945
Peter took his shoes off the scarecrow.

16
00:01:23.946 --> 00:01:27.292
Water poured out of them.

17
00:01:27.293 --> 00:01:36.373
"I guess it rained last night," he said.

18
00:01:36.374 --> 00:01:43.008
Peter took off the handkerchief.

19
00:01:43.009 --> 00:01:46.550
He put on his jacket.

20
00:01:46.551 --> 00:01:51.406
"My jacket shrank in the rain," he said.

21
00:01:51.407 --> 00:01:56.119
The scarecrow was also wearing a hat.

22
00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:00.240
Benjamin tried on the hat.

23
00:02:00.241 --> 00:02:03.925
"It's much too big," he said.

24
00:02:03.926 --> 00:02:10.451
"That's the farmer's hat," said Peter.

25
00:02:10.452 --> 00:02:14.398
He looked around nervously.

26
00:02:14.399 --> 00:02:18.543
"We should leave now," said Peter.

27
00:02:18.544 --> 00:02:22.363
"No," said Benjamin.

28
00:02:22.364 --> 00:02:30.525
"I want to get some onions!"

